---- MODULE Reachability ----
\* Generated by chart-to-tla.mjs from reachability.mmd.
\* Each region is one variable and each transition label is one action.
\* Once you add guards and variables from the real code, this file is the source.
\* statechart.mjs from-chart reachability.mmd keeps it, checks it, and compares it with the chart.

VARIABLES evidence, eligibility, classification
vars == <<evidence, eligibility, classification>>

\* Region Evidence
evidenceStates == {"Conflicting", "Current", "Expired", "Unknown"}
\* Region Eligibility
eligibilityStates == {"Eligible", "Restricted"}
\* Region Classification
classificationStates == {"Reachable", "Research"}

TypeOK ==
    /\ evidence \in evidenceStates
    /\ eligibility \in eligibilityStates
    /\ classification \in classificationStates

Init ==
    /\ evidence = "Unknown"
    /\ eligibility = "Eligible"
    /\ classification = "Research"

\* sourced finding recorded
SourcedFindingRecorded ==
    /\ \/ (evidence = "Unknown" /\ evidence' = "Current")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<eligibility, classification>>

\* evidence expires
EvidenceExpires ==
    /\ \/ (evidence = "Current" /\ evidence' = "Expired")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<eligibility, classification>>

\* discrepancy recorded
DiscrepancyRecorded ==
    /\ \/ (evidence = "Current" /\ evidence' = "Conflicting")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<eligibility, classification>>

\* discrepancy expires
DiscrepancyExpires ==
    /\ \/ (evidence = "Conflicting" /\ evidence' = "Current")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<eligibility, classification>>

\* fresh finding recorded
FreshFindingRecorded ==
    /\ \/ (evidence = "Expired" /\ evidence' = "Current")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<eligibility, classification>>

\* evidence removed
EvidenceRemoved ==
    /\ \/ (evidence = "Current" /\ evidence' = "Unknown")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<eligibility, classification>>

\* contact restricted
ContactRestricted ==
    /\ \/ (eligibility = "Eligible" /\ eligibility' = "Restricted")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<evidence, classification>>

\* restriction lifted
RestrictionLifted ==
    /\ \/ (eligibility = "Restricted" /\ eligibility' = "Eligible")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<evidence, classification>>

\* snapshot refreshed
SnapshotRefreshed ==
    /\ \/ (classification = "Research" /\ classification' = "Research")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<evidence, eligibility>>

Next == SourcedFindingRecorded \/ EvidenceExpires \/ DiscrepancyRecorded \/ DiscrepancyExpires \/ FreshFindingRecorded \/ EvidenceRemoved \/ ContactRestricted \/ RestrictionLifted \/ SnapshotRefreshed

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_vars

\* Free form identity findings cannot establish a verified usable route.
NoUnsupportedReachable == ~(classification = "Reachable")

====
